    {
      "name": "Glimpse of Redemption",
      "category": "reaction",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "reaction",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◈"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The shabti's foe hesitates under the weight of sin as visions of redemption play in their mind's eye. The foe must choose one of the following options: - The ally is unharmed by the triggering damage.",
        "- The ally gains resistance 6 to the triggering damage. After the damaging effect is applied, the enemy becomes enfeebled 2 until the end of its next turn."
      ],
      "trigger": "An enemy damages the shabti's ally, and both the enemy and ally are within 15 feet of the shabti"
